    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lock and Load!</strong></h2>Another planet infested with these disgusting BUGS!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413220/extras/2840d97cb65d814922d09d77ba4b7292.poster.avif?t=1737675135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413220/extras/2840d97cb65d814922d09d77ba4b7292.webm?t=1737675135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413220/extras/2840d97cb65d814922d09d77ba4b7292.mp4?t=1737675135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We've Got A Job to Do</strong></h2>The Exterminators have been hired to drop on these planets and wipe out the bugs, each planet is filled with dangerous creatures, the more you kill the more money you make. Get in, kill them all, get out alive. Just another day as an Exterminator.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413220/extras/b6afc115ac0d2ead5d285a9438a68194.poster.avif?t=1737675135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413220/extras/b6afc115ac0d2ead5d285a9438a68194.webm?t=1737675135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413220/extras/b6afc115ac0d2ead5d285a9438a68194.mp4?t=1737675135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We Work As A Team</strong></h2>Local Co-Op Shoot-em up action! Grab a partner and start slaying bugs together! Up to 2 players can play Exterminators with full gamepad support.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show them Who's Boss</strong></h2>Big boss battle showdowns, Exterminate the boss for a big paycheck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear Up and Roll Out</strong></h2>Gain experience from killing bugs and upgrade your abilities. Customize your Exterminator to fit your play style and kill even more bugs.<br><br>What are you waiting for? Wishlist the game NOW!",
